---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Do I own my site?',
    a: 'Yes. The domain is in your name, and the words, photos and design are yours.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Why not just use Wix or Squarespace?',
    a: "You could, and they're fine if you enjoy that sort of thing. But you'd be building it yourself and paying every month, and it tends to end up looking like everyone else's. With me it's done for you, and there's someone to message when you need a change.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I already have a domain?',
    a: "Keep it. I'll point it at the new site when it's ready, and your web address stays the same.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I update it myself?',
    a: "Most people just send me the change, and up to 30 minutes a month is included in the care plan. If there's something you want to edit yourself all the time, like a menu or a list of dates, tell me and we'll talk about setting that up.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What happens after the first 12 months?',
    a: "Stay on the care plan month to month, or stop whenever you like. If you stop, you keep your domain and I'll hand over the code so someone else can host it. Nothing locks you in.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What happens if you get hit by a bus?',
    a: "You get the code and the logins. It's your site, so another developer could pick it up and carry on.",
  },
];
---

<section class="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Questions</p>
    <h2 class="m-heading">The ones people actually ask.</h2>
    <div class="faq__list">
      {faqs.map((f) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{f.q}</summary>
          <p>{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq__list { margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 760px; }

  details { text-align: left; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }
  details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong); }

  summary {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    padding-block: 1rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

  summary::after {
    content: '+';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    transition: transform var(--transition);
  }

  details[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }

  details p { color: var(--text-muted); padding-bottom: 1.25rem; max-width: 62ch; }
</style>
